+/**
+ * .what = runs one repeatably attempt within the runner's timeout budget
+ * .why = a runner timeout fires outside any try/catch, so a slow attempt would fail the test
+ *        and never reach the next attempt. a race just under the budget turns it into a
+ *        caught failure that the repeatably wrapper can retry
